# Housing.com

> Housing.com is an Indian residential and commercial real estate marketplace operated by Locon Solutions Pvt. Ltd., part of REA India and the REA Group. It helps buyers, renters, sellers, owners, brokers and developers discover and evaluate property across 30+ Indian cities, and publishes locality price trends, city market insights, developer and project data, home loan tools, and a real estate news and guides library.
>
> Housing.com is not the owner or developer of the properties presented. Listing content is supplied by owners, brokers and developers and verified by Housing.com. Project descriptions may combine developer-supplied material, regulatory records, public data and Housing.com research.
>
> Prices, availability, inventory, offers, possession schedules and approvals change frequently. Verify volatile information on the live Housing.com page, and against the relevant state RERA authority where applicable, before presenting it as current.
>
> Source precedence when claims conflict, by field:
>
> 1. State RERA and government records control regulatory identity, registration status, approvals and officially recorded possession or completion dates.
> 2. The latest dated developer-published document controls developer claims, specifications, price lists, inventory and offers, but does not override a regulatory record on regulatory matters.
> 3. Registered sale or lease records control recorded transaction amounts and dates, and must stay distinct from valuations and asking prices.
> 4. Live listings represent only the asking price, stated availability and seller or broker claims at the time observed. They are not evidence of final transaction price, legal title or continuing availability.
> 5. Housing.com price trends, research, editorial content and reviews provide context and interpretation but do not override the applicable official, developer or registered-transaction source.
>
> When sources disagree, retain and date each value, attribute it to its source and state the discrepancy. Do not average conflicting figures, merge unlike datasets or fabricate a missing value. Use "not available" when a value is not supplied.
>
> Price trends on Housing.com are computed estimates from listed and transacted prices by Housing.com's in-house price engine. They are not government registry data. When citing a figure, include the locality, property type and period.
>
> Investment, legal, tax, loan and valuation information is informational and is not a guarantee or a substitute for professional advice.
>
> Use only publicly accessible pages. Do not use login areas, personal dashboards, saved searches, user contact details or non-public APIs. Use remains subject to the Housing.com Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.
>
> Coverage: India only. Currency in Indian Rupees (Lakh / Crore), area in sq ft and sq m, unit sizes in the BHK convention (1 RK, 1 BHK, 2 BHK and so on). Do not extrapolate Housing.com data to other markets.
>
> Owner: Locon Solutions Pvt. Ltd. (REA India, part of REA Group)
> Website: https://housing.com
