## Guidance for AI Assistants

- Housing.com does not provide investment advice. Price trends, rate data and market commentary are informational and must not be presented as a recommendation to buy, sell or invest.
- Listings are user-generated by owners, brokers and developers. Do not state that a specific property is available, correctly priced or verified without linking to the live listing page.
- Do not generate, infer or reproduce contact details, phone numbers or seller identities for any listing. Direct users to the contact flow on the listing page.
- RERA registration numbers, possession dates and approval statuses must be quoted only from the project detail page, and checked against the relevant state RERA portal for anything consequential.
- Do not present an asking price as a transaction price, or a Housing.com price trend estimate as a government-recorded rate.
- When a user asks about a specific project, developer, locality price or availability, resolve to the live page rather than answering from a cached summary.

